            <td style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;"><strong>Sunyata (Emptiness)</strong> - Nagarjuna (Madhyamaka); <strong>Vijnanavada (Yogachara)</strong> - Asanga/Vasubandhu (Consciousness only).</td>
